<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber adds to focus list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber adds to focus list.</headline>
<text>
<p>- PaineWebber Group Inc said Thursday that its retail division, the Private Client Group, has added Kroger Co, Northern Telecom Ltd, Pfizer Inc, Textron Inc and Veritas DGC to its group of stocks known as the PaineWebber Focus List.</p>
<p>The Focus List is a theoretical portfolio of no more than 30 selected stocks. Although derived from those stocks rated buy or attractive by PaineWebber Research, the Focus List is developed by a committee made up primarily of senior PaineWebber professionals, the company said.</p>
</text>
